cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this platform, please cite it as below."
title: "Physics-to-Life: learning the physical resolution required to predict and repair living systems"
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/in-c0/human-repair-map"
abstract: >-
  Research platform for testing whether a learned controller can decide when additional
  physical detail is worth computing in multiscale models of living systems. Contains the
  hypothesis registry, the validation ladder (V0 synthetic slow-fast network upward), and
  reproducible adaptive-fidelity experiments with hidden ground truth.
authors:
  - name: "Physics-to-Life contributors"
